{"resourceIdentifier":"4549","resourceName":"Heze Tech-Bank Animal Waste Management Systems (AWMS) GHG Mitigation Project","description":"Heze Tech-Bank Animal Waste Management Systems (AWMS) GHG Mitigation Project in Shandong Province (hereafter referred to as the project) installs new animal waste management systems (AWMS) to treat the manure from 6 newly built farms in Juancheng County, Heze City, Shandong Province of the People’s Republic of China(35°33'36.13 N 115°38'13.54 E), which are owned by Tech-Bank Food Co., Ltd. Each subsidiary swine farm installs one AWMS, and the biogas produced is recovered and destroyed on-site by flare. The purpose of the project activity is to treat the manure and wastewater to avoid methane emissions generated in the baseline uncovered anaerobic lagoons. There are 148,300 heads of market swine and 48,000 heads of breeding be cultivated swine in these 6 swine farms, the volumes of manure and wastewater treated are 1883.98 m³/d and 323.82 m³/d respectively, and 868,861 m³ of biogas are expected to be generated by the project per year, which would be recovered and destroyed directly by the flare system.\r\nThe project activity will reduce GHG emissions into the atmosphere through avoiding methane emissions from the anaerobic treatment of swine manure and wastewater. The annually emission reduction is estimated as 120,184 tCO2e, and the total emission reductions are estimated as 1,201,841 tCO2e throughout the crediting period, which is fixed 10 years start from 1-August-2022 to 31-July-2032.","location":{"latitude":35.560035,"longitude":115.637095},"inPublicCommentPeriod":true,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":null,"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4549"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Shandong"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Tech-Bank Food Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Anhui Province, China"},{"type":"string","value":"+86 181 0517 9175"},{"type":"string","value":"1090757710@qq.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Verification approval requested"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"120184"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Livestock, enteric fermentation, and manure management"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0010"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"06/11/2025"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 01/08/2022 - 31/07/2032"}]}]},{"programCode":"SDVISTA","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Tech-Bank Food Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Anhui Province, China"},{"type":"string","value":"+86 181 0517 9175"},{"type":"string","value":"1090757710@qq.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Undergoing validation and verification"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"120184"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Livelihoods"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"FIRST_VERIFICATION_VER_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROGRAM_OBJECTIVE_CODE","values":[{"type":"image","value":"01__NO_POVERTY; 08__DECENT_WORK_AND_ECONOMIC_GRO; 12__RESPONSIBLE_CONSUMPTION_AND; 13__CLIMATE_ACTION"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=96006&IDKEY=9q934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulkandDfdvDdfhj132392274","documentType":"Draft Project D